WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.115
Time to have a go.

00:00:02.135 --> 00:00:05.283
You only need a phone
and about ten minutes.

00:00:05.733 --> 00:00:06.954
Pick one app.

00:00:07.556 --> 00:00:11.424
ChatGPT, Gemini, Claude or Copilot.

00:00:11.584 --> 00:00:15.545
All of them have a free version, and
they all work much the same way.

00:00:16.008 --> 00:00:20.108
Download it from your
app store, and sign in.

00:00:20.558 --> 00:00:24.404
At the bottom of the screen there's a box
that says something like Ask anything,

00:00:24.424 --> 00:00:26.040
and a little microphone.

00:00:26.073 --> 00:00:28.896
You can type, or you can talk.

00:00:29.346 --> 00:00:31.008
Start with a real job.

00:00:31.471 --> 00:00:33.841
Give it the who, the what and the when.

00:00:34.002 --> 00:00:35.408
Something like this.

00:00:35.755 --> 00:00:38.694
Write a short text to
my shearing contractor.

00:00:39.296 --> 00:00:43.328
We've got two thousand ewes near Kurow,
and we'd like the second week of

00:00:43.348 --> 00:00:44.975
December.

00:00:47.925 --> 00:00:49.494
Read what comes back.

00:00:49.585 --> 00:00:53.813
If it's not quite right, just
tell it, like you would a person.

00:00:53.904 --> 00:00:55.938
Make it shorter and less formal.

00:00:56.400 --> 00:00:59.885
Or, add that the woolshed
power is fixed now.

00:01:02.835 --> 00:01:06.157
If it gets a detail wrong, say so plainly.

00:01:06.248 --> 00:01:08.526
No, it's December, not November.

00:01:08.686 --> 00:01:10.454
It fixes it and carries on.

00:01:10.474 --> 00:01:12.148
There's no magic wording.

00:01:12.309 --> 00:01:16.235
Talk to it the way you'd brief
someone new on the farm.

00:01:16.685 --> 00:01:19.461
It remembers what you've
said so far in that chat.

00:01:20.226 --> 00:01:24.014
When you move on to a new job, start
a fresh chat with the plus or pencil

00:01:24.034 --> 00:01:28.041
icon, so the old details
don't get mixed in.

00:01:28.491 --> 00:01:31.269
Talking works well in
the ute or the yards.

00:01:31.289 --> 00:01:34.065
Most apps have a voice
mode where you just talk,

00:01:34.157 --> 00:01:35.528
and it talks back.

00:01:35.782 --> 00:01:40.776
Only use it when you're parked up, or
when it's safe and legal to do so.

00:01:41.226 --> 00:01:42.959
One rule before you start.

00:01:42.979 --> 00:01:46.175
Don't put in anything you wouldn't
put in an email to a stranger.

00:01:46.195 --> 00:01:49.403
Bank details, passwords,
people's personal information.

00:01:49.423 --> 00:01:51.793
Leave them out.

00:01:52.243 --> 00:01:56.136
Below the video there's a card
with five first questions to try.

00:01:56.156 --> 00:02:01.231
Pick one, have a go, and see what it
does with a real job from your week.
